#lang rmn/v2
(map
  ("type" "AcceptanceOracleAssayLaw")
  ("version" 2)
  ("precondition" "One signed A2A request carries a canonical RMN subject with bounded source evidence measures, executable oracle artifacts with exact bytes and digests, one red execution witness, and exact structured vector identifiers.")
  ("operation" "Mechanically check only: each declared source measure has a unique path, digest, and byte measure; each oracle artifact has a unique path whose supplied bytes match its digest and measure; vector identifiers are present and unique; and the completed red execution witness is failed, digest-bound, and names exactly the declared vector identifiers. Do not dispatch inference, compare opinions, author a candidate, execute an oracle, or infer behavior from a marker.")
  ("postcondition" "Return one canonical RMN receipt binding the exact subject, provider smart account, measured source and artifact projections, declared vector identifiers, measured red witness, mechanical failures, and an assay Boolean distinct from protected-capsule sealing and customer acceptance; append through the hired witness-journal RDF provider.")
  ("refusal" "Refuse a noncanonical carrier, implementation review, oracle authorship, model dispatch, retry, execution, mutation, usefulness acceptance, or claims beyond the mechanical assay."))
